! jb_ax4b "IBOX-4", routine 1238 test 3, first check, p.66 (octal
! 005546.00-005550.40): "-TEST 3." -- RCZ (Refill on Count Zero).
!
! WHY THIS BLOCK.  RCZ was the LAST of the operations a whole-opcode
! screen found implemented but driven by nothing.  Its companion R is
! closed by ibox4_refill from test 1 of the same routine; this is the
! six half-words that close RCZ.
!
! WHAT IT CHECKS, in one step.  I38K1 is an index word whose COUNT IS
! ZERO and whose refill names I38XW3, so the single RCZ must fire and
! replace $X0 with I38XW3's word; KV then compares the two.  The
! listing's error text is the specification: "RCZ FAILS TO REFILL WHEN
! CT ZERO".
!
! I38XW3 is deliberately unlike anything else in storage --
! value 123456.76, count 543210, refill 123456 -- so a refill that
! happened but landed somewhere else cannot compare equal by accident.
!
! AND A NOTE ON WHY ibox4_refill WAS THE BLOCK THAT CAUGHT THE OPERAND
! BUG, not this one.  execute() used to read `st.readIndex(bm.idx)`
! where the operand is the EFFECTIVE ADDRESS.  Here the two coincide:
! "RCZ,$X0" addresses word 020 = word 16 = index register 0, and its
! idx field is also 0, so the old arm would have passed this check by
! luck.  Test 1's "R,$X15" addresses word 037 = word 31 = index
! register 15 with idx = 0, where the two differ -- and that is the one
! that halted.  A block only discriminates where its operands make the
! wrong answer different from the right one.
!
! WHAT IS LEFT of test 3: after this check it goes on to "CHECK ZERO
! GATING OF RCZ", an SVA-driven loop over I3829-I3833 that walks a
! count down with C-I and verifies RCZ does NOT refill while the count
! is non-zero.  Not transcribed here.

        SLC, (8)1304.0
SERS    BEW, $
        SLC, (8)1310.0
SEN     DD(BU,64,8), 0

! -- constants for 1238 (p.67) --
        SLC, (8)5574.0
I38XW3  XW, (8)123456.76, (8)543210, (8)123456
        SLC, (8)5625.0
I38K1   XW, 0, 0, I38XW3                     ! count 0, refill -> I38XW3

        SLC, (8)5546.0
I3828   LX, $X0, I38K1                       ! start check of RCZ.
        RCZ, $X0
        KV, $X0, I38XW3
        BXE, $+1.32
        SIC, SEN
        B, SERS                              ! RCZ fails to refill when ct zero.
PASS    BEW, $
        END, I3828
